u003csummary\\u003e\\nCreate \\u0026amp; Scale on Roblox - m4rrh3w\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eRoblox is not a game but a platform; a future platform for communication and connection, allowing the creation of anything everywhere by everyone.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eTo ensure that Roblox can be global, real-time translation has been implemented to the content, including text and voice chat features. Additionally, investment in AI has made creation easier. Tools, such as \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/t/code-assist-full-release-ai-powered-code-completion/2848978\\\&quot;\\u003ecode assist\\u003c/a\\u003e, \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/t/material-generator-is-now-available-for-everyone/3145555\\\&quot;\\u003ematerial generator\\u003c/a\\u003e, \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/t/texture-generator-beta/2880635\\\&quot;\\u003etexture generator\\u003c/a\\u003e, etc., are all backed up by AI to make creativity the main focus. Monetization is a huge part of creation, and there are both standard and unique methods for doing so. The bottom line is… Roblox is THE platform to create! With various assisting features/methods provided by Roblox, creators can only focus on letting out their inner creative minds.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eLastly, many Korean games, experiences, and creators were spotlighted: \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://www.roblox.com/games/15532962292/Sols-RNG-Eon1-1\\\&quot;\\u003eSol’s RNG\\u003c/a\\u003e, \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://www.roblox.com/games/6445435958/unnamed\\\&quot;\\u003eA tower that can’t be broken\\u003c/a\\u003e, \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://www.roblox.com/games/5720801512/unnamed\\\&quot;\\u003eKorean Murder\\u003c/a\\u003e, \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://www.roblox.com/games/12202678406/TWICE-Square-UPDATE\\\&quot;\\u003eTWICE Square\\u003c/a\\u003e, \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://www.roblox.com/games/6430630495/Korean-BBQ-Restaurant-Preparing-for-a-remake\\\&quot;\\u003eKorean BBQ Restaurant\\u003c/a\\u003e, \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://www.roblox.com/games/15413903718/unnamed\\\&quot;\\u003eKorean Food\\u003c/a\\u003e, and \\u003ca class=\\\&quot;mention\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;/u/didigamedev\\\&quot;\\u003e@DIDIgamedev\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cdiv class=\\\&quot;lightbox-wrapper\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003ca class=\\\&quot;lightbox\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;//devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/original/5X/e/8/7/f/e87fefa39b8d53e1466994e8142137aab19151fd.png\\\&quot; data-download-href=\\\&quot;/uploads/short-url/xaMSfjRVz9Go8U2blefGprE4cr3.png?dl=1\\\&quot; title=\\\&quot;\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003cimg src=\\\&quot;//devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/optimized/5X/e/8/7/f/e87fefa39b8d53e1466994e8142137aab19151fd_2_624x359.png\\\&quot; alt=\\\&quot;\\\&quot; data-base62-sha1=\\\&quot;xaMSfjRVz9Go8U2blefGprE4cr3\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;624\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;359\\\&quot; role=\\\&quot;presentation\\\&quot; srcset=\\\&quot;//devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/optimized/5X/e/8/7/f/e87fefa39b8d53e1466994e8142137aab19151fd_2_624x359.png, //devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/optimized/5X/e/8/7/f/e87fefa39b8d53e1466994e8142137aab19151fd_2_936x538.png 1.5x, //devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/optimized/5X/e/8/7/f/e87fefa39b8d53e1466994e8142137aab19151fd_2_1248x718.png 2x\\\&quot; data-dominant-color=\\\&quot;3F3E44\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003cdiv class=\\\&quot;meta\\\&quot;\\u003e\\n\\u003csvg class=\\\&quot;fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\\\&quot; aria-hidden=\\\&quot;true\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003cuse href=\\\&quot;#far-image\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/use\\u003e\\u003c/svg\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;filename\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;informations\\\&quot;\\u003e1600×919 819 KB\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003csvg class=\\\&quot;fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\\\&quot; aria-hidden=\\\&quot;true\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003cuse href=\\\&quot;#discourse-expand\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/use\\u003e\\u003c/svg\\u003e\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003e\\nMonetization on Roblox - Six5Creedmore\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eMonetization on Roblox is key when creating exciting live experiences that engage with users. In this workshop, we went over essential elements of monetization as well as best practices and common strategies that many users find appealing.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eItems and the shop are the two core foundations of monetization. Items need to fit seamlessly into the experience and provide value along with descriptions that are truthful and accurate. The shop acts as the primary space for items by showcasing the economy and variety of content while offering a personalized and engaging experience for users.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eAttract attention and communicate value to users through merchandising. For example, \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/t/announcing-feature-packages/3301611\\\&quot;\\u003eStarter Packs\\u003c/a\\u003e play a pivotal role in the new user experience, while discounts and bonuses offer additional value for users. Choose a creative merchandising method that is unique and keeps users engaged in the experience!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cdiv class=\\\&quot;lightbox-wrapper\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003ca class=\\\&quot;lightbox\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;//devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/original/5X/2/b/6/9/2b6994ba093e8dadf929676300ba94a283cc4d01.png\\\&quot; data-download-href=\\\&quot;/uploads/short-url/6c2JIzfjqabadRcNYCaLGJBBTeV.png?dl=1\\\&quot; title=\\\&quot;\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003cimg src=\\\&quot;//devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/optimized/5X/2/b