 on Blender, how to export the file so it is Roblox platform-friendly, how to upload the UGC item and more. The end product of the workshop was a \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://www.roblox.com/catalog/104446081472018/Penguin-Cap\\\&quot;\\u003ePenguin Cap\\u003c/a\\u003e accessory item!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cdiv class=\\\&quot;lightbox-wrapper\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003ca class=\\\&quot;lightbox\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;//devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/original/5X/7/0/8/a/708af5cf80f441bd27349a3c03b0f9e0ea1ea810.png\\\&quot; data-download-href=\\\&quot;/uploads/short-url/g3BcfloXXmwNZyF2QLKpol9sSru.png?dl=1\\\&quot; title=\\\&quot;\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003cimg src=\\\&quot;//devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/optimized/5X/7/0/8/a/708af5cf80f441bd27349a3c03b0f9e0ea1ea810_2_444x321.png\\\&quot; alt=\\\&quot;\\\&quot; data-base62-sha1=\\\&quot;g3BcfloXXmwNZyF2QLKpol9sSru\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;444\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;321\\\&quot; role=\\\&quot;presentation\\\&quot; srcset=\\\&quot;//devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/optimized/5X/7/0/8/a/708af5cf80f441bd27349a3c03b0f9e0ea1ea810_2_444x321.png, //devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/optimized/5X/7/0/8/a/708af5cf80f441bd27349a3c03b0f9e0ea1ea810_2_666x481.png 1.5x, //devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/optimized/5X/7/0/8/a/708af5cf80f441bd27349a3c03b0f9e0ea1ea810_2_888x642.png 2x\\\&quot; data-dominant-color=\\\&quot;51545C\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003cdiv class=\\\&quot;meta\\\&quot;\\u003e\\n\\u003csvg class=\\\&quot;fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\\\&quot; aria-hidden=\\\&quot;true\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003cuse href=\\\&quot;#far-image\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/use\\u003e\\u003c/svg\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;filename\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\&quot;informations\\\&quot;\\u003e1310×948 1.76 MB\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003csvg class=\\\&quot;fa d-icon d-