<summary>
Managing and Growing Your Game - Nosniy and SenseiWarrior</summary>
<p>In building <a href="https://www.roblox.com/games/17625359962/RIVALS">Rivals</a>, there were several aspects such as creating a consistent update schedule, growing a community, planning roadmaps, and prioritizing gameplay over monetization to create a successful game. Update schedules should have reasonable quality content. For growing a community, using social media platforms is a great way to engage players, ask for feedback and ideas, and market the experience. Planning roadmaps makes it easier to make progress because everyone knows their role. Finally, prioritizing gameplay over monetization is important, as content is what drives the game forward and creates natural support from players who want to keep playing the game.</p>
