<summary>
Monetization on Roblox - Six5Creedmore</summary>
<p>Monetization on Roblox is key when creating exciting live experiences that engage with users. In this workshop, we went over essential elements of monetization as well as best practices and common strategies that many users find appealing.</p>
<p>Items and the shop are the two core foundations of monetization. Items need to fit seamlessly into the experience and provide value along with descriptions that are truthful and accurate. The shop acts as the primary space for items by showcasing the economy and variety of content while offering a personalized and engaging experience for users.</p>
<p>Attract attention and communicate value to users through merchandising. For example, <a href="https://devforum.roblox.com/t/announcing-feature-packages/3301611">Starter Packs</a> play a pivotal role in the new user experience, while discounts and bonuses offer additional value for users. Choose a creative merchandising method that is unique and keeps users engaged in the experience!</p>
