UGC Item Creation Process - Gold_Octopus</summary>
<p>One of the KR Community Ambassadors, <a class="mention" href="/u/gold_octopus">@Gold_Octopus</a>, led a live workshop on Blender, showcasing how easy and quick it is to create and upload your own UGC item onto Roblox. He covered all aspects that are involved in creating a UGC item, from figuring out different shapes and textures of the item on Blender, how to export the file so it is Roblox platform-friendly, how to upload the UGC item and more. The end product of the workshop was a <a href="https://www.roblox.com/catalog/104446081472018/Penguin-Cap">Penguin Cap</a> accessory item!</p>
